    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of 1979 by insertingsection 144A in that Act and the legal effect of the amendment is to make provisions to empowerthe Magistrate to dispense personal attendance of a suspect or accused in court under thecircumstances specified in that section.",
