    "bbox": [
      227.71,
      202.97,
      397.17,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)the suspect or accused himself, orhis Attorney- at- Law, as the casemay be; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.71,
      250.97,
      397.17,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)the officer in charge of the relevantpolice station; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      229.87,
      286.97,
      397.17,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)the Superintendent of the prisonwherein the suspect or accused isdetained.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      334.97,
      397.17,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "(4) The Magistrate may dispense with thepersonal attendance of the suspect or accusedunder subsection (1), on the followinggrounds:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      229.87,
      394.97,
      397.17,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)where there is a threat or anapprehension of serious harm to thelife of the suspect or accused;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      229.87,
      442.97,
      397.19,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)where public reaction to the offencealleged to have been committed bythe suspect or accused is likely togive rise to a breach of the peace;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.71,
      502.97,
      397.17,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)where there is a likelihood of thesuspect or accused escaping fromdetention or being involuntarilyremoved from detention; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      229.87,
      562.97,
      397.17,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)where there is a likelihood of thesuspect or accused obstructing theproceedings of court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      610.97,
      397.18,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(5) Where a Magistrate dispenses with thepersonal attendance of a suspect or an accusedin court, under subsection (1), the reasons forthe same shall be recorded in writing and suchsuspect or accused shall be permitted-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
